; No (package ...) field, so this theory is built by dune build and checked by
; CI while dune build @install leaves it out of what an opam installation
; ships. It is a guard, not part of the library.

; An umbrella defines nothing, so it cannot fail to compile on its own: it
; either forwards what its modules hold or silently does not. One file here
; per umbrella, each importing that umbrella alone, is what makes the
; difference visible -- a file importing two would receive from one whatever
; the other fails to forward.

; The full dependency closure is listed, not only the direct dependencies,
; so the position of this theory in the stack can be read off this file.

(rocq.theory
 (name jwa_test)
 (theories
  jwa
  jwa.Core
  jwa.Tactics
  jwa.Structures
  jwa.Relations
  jwa.Data
  jwa.Algebra
  jwa.Programming))
